DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nRetirement Planning\nSynopsis\n:\n- What are some tip
	s and strategies to prepare for retirement?\n- In view of the increased lo
	ngevity\, inflation of medical costs\, and an environment of geopolitical 
	instability and market volatility\, What are some important considerations
	 when planning for retirement.\n- Heavy reliance on personal savings and p
	ension schemes for retirement – how can we go beyond to secure our finan
	cial security In retirement?\nSpeaker\n:\nKwee Juan HAN\nJoining Instructi
	ons\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay
	 Financial Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instru
	ctions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant usin
	g DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop
	.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com
	/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to 
	the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre fo
	r optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on thi
	s hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTI
	D=e7716564ccfe56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Nam
	e\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1
	.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nCl
	ick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input Passwo
	rd 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapor
	e)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumb
	ai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 
	5933\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?M
	TID=e8b348588cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230720T145000
